!data/**/README.md

# Keep the models folder but ignore huge artifacts if you prefer.
# To deploy on Render's free tier you DO want to commit the trained model,
# so it is NOT ignored by default. Uncomment the next lines to exclude it:
# models/*.keras
# models/*.h5

